        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woho, ifuku damu chisatu chidinashiki, Esita hakuvwala wuvwaluwindi wawanta, hakwimana mwibulu damukachi dakwitala damwanta, datala kwitala damwanta; mwanta wadiŋi washakama hetanda dindidawanta mwitala dawanta, natali kuchisu chakwitala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta chanamoniyi mwadi Esita nemani mwibulu, yena Esita hakumona wuselewa kudi yena. Mwanta hakumwolwela Esita nkimyi yawuru yadiŋi kuchikasachindi, Esita hakukundama kwakwihi, hakukunka kunamutu wankunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakumwila nindi, Eyi mwadi Esita, wunakeŋidi? Wukukeŋakulombadi? Akukwinka tuhu hela chashikila muchibalu chawanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita nindi, Neyi mwanta namoni nindi chinawahi, mwanta naHamanienzi lelu kuchawija chinamuloŋesheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nindi, Mwilenu Hamanianyakali twili mwanahoshiyi Esita. Dichi mwanta naHamani hiyakuyakuchawija chaloŋesheliyi Esita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwenoku kwanwininuwu vinyu mwanta hakumwila Esita, nindi, Wunakeŋidi? Akakwinka hohu. Wukukeŋa kulombadi? Akachikoŋa hohu hela chashikila muchibalu chawanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita hakwakula nindi, Atiyi munukukeŋa, atiyi munukulomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi nawani wuselewa kumesuamwanta, neyi mwanta wukutiya kuwaha kunyinka chuma chinakeŋi, eli chuma chinukulomba, mwanta naHamani akenzi cheŋi kuchawija achinu kuyiloŋeshela, kumadiki nakela mwanahoshiyi mwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Denodu ifuku Hamani wedi kili nakuzaŋalala nakutiya kuwaha kumuchima. Ilaŋa Hamani chamweniyi Modekayi muchisu chamwanta kwimananehi, hela kudinyinkesha tuhu nehi, hakumutiya Modekayi kumuchima patinandombu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu Hamani wadiwunjikili, hakuya nikwitala dindi. Hakupompesha niamabwambu jindi niŋodindi Zereshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamanihakuyihitulwila mukulema kwamahetindi, nimwavulila anyanindi, nimwamulemeshelu wukudi mwanta mwejima, nimwamumotwesheluwu hadiatulamba nihadi ambuŋa mwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamani hakulunjikaku niizudi kwawu, nindi, Eŋa, mwadi Esita hetiya muntu weŋi kwijila namwanta kuchawija achaloŋe sheliyuku, chiŋa ami hohu, anantambiki nawa kudi yena kuyahamu namwanta kumadiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, chinamonaŋa kaYudeya Modekayi saŋa ashakaminayi muchisu chamwanta, hinatiyaŋa kuwahanayuma yejimiyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋodindi Zereshi, nawamabwambu jindi ejima, hiyakumwila nawu, Imikaku mutondu wawulehi washika munkotweli jachikasa makumi atanu, habudidi wakahosha namwanta akamukudikuhu Modekayi, hiwakaya namwanta kuchawija nakuzaŋalala. Chumichi chamutiyishili Hamani kuwaha, hakwimikisha nimutondu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
